ent-BookScp049Diary = leather diary
    .desc =
        A small hardbound book covered in worn black-brown leather. The cover edges are cracked, and signs of wear are visible at the folds.
        There is no clasp or fastener, however the leather around the spine has darkened significantly, as if from constant handling.
        The paper inside is yellowed, with signs of moisture visible in places. When opened, it carries a faint smell of old leather and mildew.
    .suffix = SCP-049
